{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ana only needs six seeds from the depths of the forest. That's all. Then she can go home.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/2025-06-12_13-14-23-ezgif.com-cut__1_.gif?t=1750707650\" /><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/arrow3.png?t=1750707650\" />\u00a0Explore freely through the forest and the cabin, gathering unique ingredients and items. Brew infusions and cook strange meals that will help you interact with curious characters, each with their own personality and secrets. Use a special item that reveals hidden objects and essential clues, creating an experience full of exploration and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/arrow3.png?t=1750707650\" />\u00a0Conversations and choices influence how the story unfolds, inviting you to slowly uncover the truth behind this unsettling place. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/ingredients.png?t=1750707650\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/arrow3.png?t=1750707650\" /><strong>\u00a0Atmospheric Exploration:\u00a0</strong>Wander through a forgotten place where everything has meaning.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/arrow3.png?t=1750707650\" /><strong>\u00a0Cozy Interactions:</strong> Cook questionable food, brew drinks, unlock doors, collect odd objects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/arrow3.png?t=1750707650\" /><strong>\u00a0Kept in the Dark:\u00a0</strong>Some things are hidden for a reason. You're not meant to see it all\u2014yet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/arrow3.png?t=1750707650\" /><strong>\u00a0Strange Items &amp; Hidden Clues:\u00a0</strong>Perfect for players seeking slow-burn suspense and immersive storytelling over fast-paced action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/arrow3.png?t=1750707650\" /><strong>\u00a0Unusual Characters:\u00a0</strong>Meet others\u2026 if they let you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/arrow3.png?t=1750707650\" /><strong>\u00a0No jumpscares:\u00a0</strong>Suspenseful horror focused on atmosphere and unease, no loud surprises. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/1.jpg?t=1750707650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0Wander the forest, gather strange plants, &amp; share coffee with mysterious beings in <i>Nightfall Caf\u00e9</i>.\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/43.png?t=1750707650\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816920?t=1750707650","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/7d02175d77669f7c894f429c1f0bb41a8a838be5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750707650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/777d46c3f5724